---
// EnviarNoticia.astro - Sección simplificada de contacto directo (sin formulario)
---

<section id="enviar-noticia" class="enviar-noticia-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="enviar-card">
      <div class="enviar-content">
        
        <div class="badge-wrap">
          <span class="badge badge-burgundy">PARTICIPACIÓN CIUDADANA</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="enviar-title">Envíanos tu noticia</h2>
        
        <p class="enviar-desc">
          ¿Tienes una denuncia comunitaria, un acontecimiento o una noticia de tu distrito o caserío en el Valle La Leche? Escríbenos directamente para incluirlo en nuestra próxima edición semanal.
        </p>

        <!-- Canales directos de contacto -->
        <div class="contact-actions">
          <a 
            href="https://wa.me/51948100794?text=Hola%20Tribuna%20Mochica,%20deseo%20enviar%20una%20noticia/denuncia%20para%20el%20peri%C3%B3dico:" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn btn-whatsapp-direct"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Escribir al WhatsApp (+51 948 100 794)</span>
          </a>

          <a 
            href="mailto:central.mochica.de.prensa@gmail.com?subject=Noticia%20para%20Tribuna%20Mochica" 
            class="btn btn-email-direct"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect>
              <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Enviar por Correo Electrónico</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Notas de confianza -->
        <div class="enviar-pills">
          <div class="pill-item">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
            <span>Reserva de identidad garantizada</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pill-item">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 14 14"></polyline></svg>
            <span>Revisión para la edición de cada semana</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .enviar-noticia-section {
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }

  .enviar-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FAF8F2 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .enviar-card {
      padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
    }
  }

  .enviar-content {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .badge-wrap {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .enviar-title {
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .enviar-title {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }
  }

  .enviar-desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .contact-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .btn-whatsapp-direct {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    background-color: #25D366;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.25);
  }

  .btn-whatsapp-direct:hover {
    background-color: #1EBE5D;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.35);
  }

  .btn-email-direct {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    color: var(--color-burgundy);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-burgundy);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-email-direct:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-burgundy-subtle);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .enviar-pills {
    display: flex
